  "text": "The sky grew cloudy as Joy and her friends walked to the playground. Roy brought his new toy raft to sail in the puddles. A loud sound of thunder made everyone shout and run for cover. They found a spot under a wide awning and waited out the storm. Soon the clouds parted, and the boys and girls went back to play.",
